The `get_args_list` function uses the `strtok` function to tokenize the command string based on space and newline delimiters. It handles arguments enclosed within double quotes by concatenating subsequent tokens until the ending quote is found. The function populates the `arg_list` array with individual arguments and returns the total number of arguments parsed."}]

